    "title": "Suspicious item at Tarzana homeless encampment prompts bomb squad response - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By City News Service ,\n9 hours ago\nA suspicious item found at a homeless encampment in Tarzana prompted a bomb squad investigation Wednesday morning.\nWant to get caught up on what's happening in SoCal every weekday afternoon? Click to follow The L.A. Local wherever you get podcasts.\nThe item was reported around 10:15 a.m. Wednesday in the area of Reseda and Ventura boulevards, according to the Los Angeles Police Department\nReseda Boulevard was closed between Burbank and Ventura boulevards as the investigation continued into the late morning.\nFollow KNX News 97.1 FM",
